{{High Risk|Template:Category|nocat=1|pagetype=Main}}
Adds the current page to <code>[[:Category:&lt;name&gt;]]</code> from within a template. Categorization is skipped automatically on <code>/preload</code> subpages, so it is safe inside a preloadable template. A helper for '''programmatic''' categorization — for ordinary pages, add categories directly.

==Syntax==
{{T|Category|v1=category-name}}

==Examples==
The example below is shown as code only — a live call would categorize this documentation page.
* {{T|Category|p1=Active Singers}} → adds the page to [[:Category:Active Singers]]

